    "user_profile": {
      "name": "carol",
      "real_name": "Carol",
      "display_name": "carol",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730948640.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "76b08a241ac72951b8",
    "text": "let's look at our historical data... checking grafana",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730952360.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "b01208aeabe1b397d7",
    "text": "ok so we have services that routinely hit 1.5% during normal load. we don't want to warn on those",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U48181ACD22",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730953080.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "c3516068b8bcecf647",
    "text": "so what threshold won't catch normal noise?",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "bob",
      "real_name": "Bob",
      "display_name": "bob",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "UBFCDF3E6CA",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730953320.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "541c596198d96a001d",
    "text": "what if we go with 0.01? that's 1% error rate. our normal range is 0.1-0.8%, so 1% would catch real degradation",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "dave",
      "real_name": "Dave",
      "display_name": "dave",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730954040.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "4d1e945f4650f8616a",
    "text": "0.01 looks right from the grafana data. our p99 of normal error rate is about 0.8%",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U28B92B56EE",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730954820.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "5df00c0a6e246eb56a",
    "text": "agreed: warning if error_rate >= 0.01",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "carol",
      "real_name": "Carol",
      "display_name": "carol",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U48181ACD22",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730955240.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "46f195f78b7f08d088",
    "text": "so we dropped 0.02 in favor of 0.01 for warning? just confirming",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "bob",
      "real_name": "Bob",
      "display_name": "bob",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730956260.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "d013ee2e51253f400e",
    "text": "yes, settled on >= 0.01 for warning threshold after looking at the histogram",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U2A4B17B116",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730956860.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "25cdb1268e756b7459",
    "text": "and budget warning threshold?",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "erin",
      "real_name": "Erin",
      "display_name": "erin",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U28B92B56EE",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730957940.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "50389e86ea23261282",
    "text": "I'd say 80% - when we're 80% through the budget, we should be aware",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "carol",
      "real_name": "Carol",
      "display_name": "carol",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "UBFCDF3E6CA",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730959020.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "d97012fde953d9cd97",
    "text": "80% is a common industry standard",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "dave",
      "real_name": "Dave",
      "display_name": "dave",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730963640.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "a869eb464c1ef175cc",
    "text": "hmm, but 80% might not give us enough warning time for some of our longer SLO windows",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U6525ABCCE7",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730964180.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "22d2047426f0054159",
    "text": "what about 75%? that's a quarter of budget remaining, gives more runway",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "niaj",
      "real_name": "Niaj",
      "display_name": "niaj",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U86A8C2DA85",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730965200.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "287b90119861d0bf6d",
    "text": "75% seems overly conservative. we'll warn too often",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "frank",
      "real_name": "Frank",
      "display_name": "frank",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730966400.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "9f128de098519b606f",
    "text": "I think 75% is right actually. it's a clear three-quarter mark and gives us real warning time",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U48181ACD22",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730967060.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "a619db204f103f31a0",
    "text": "the debate is 75 vs 80. I'll go with whatever alice decides",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "bob",
      "real_name": "Bob",
      "display_name": "bob",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730967600.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "3d95888335fb1894d4",
    "text": "75%. final answer. warning if budget_consumed_pct > 75",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U28B92B56EE",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730968560.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "721102d1adaea87bc9",
    "text": "so warning: error_rate >= 0.01 OR budget_consumed_pct > 75. confirmed",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "carol",
      "real_name": "Carol",
      "display_name": "carol",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "UBFCDF3E6CA",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730968920.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "221a77867b5ee8ad66",
    "text": "now the paging condition. this is the key piece",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "dave",
      "real_name": "Dave",
      "display_name": "dave",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U86A8C2DA85",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730969160.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "76b42500bddc2a8326",
    "text": "simple: page on all warnings. if it's worth calling warning it's worth paging",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "frank",
      "real_name": "Frank",
      "display_name": "frank",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730970240.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "750254a95f996d6194",
    "text": "no, that defeats the purpose. warning means 'watch this', not 'wake someone up at 3am'",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U28B92B56EE",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730975580.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "19f73ced63158d0cab",
    "text": "frank's suggestion would bring back the alert fatigue we're trying to fix",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "carol",
      "real_name": "Carol",
      "display_name": "carol",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U86A8C2DA85",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730975940.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "c4d2a56530e876b9bd",
    "text": "ok ok, fair enough. not all warnings",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "frank",
      "real_name": "Frank",
      "display_name": "frank",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U48181ACD22",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730976120.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "25a9d62f7ca08eec6a",
    "text": "so when do we page on warning? we need some condition",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "bob",
      "real_name": "Bob",
      "display_name": "bob",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "UBFCDF3E6CA",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730976660.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "4ce0b1564b1cd5c93c",
    "text": "what if we page on warning only when latency is also elevated? that usually indicates a real user impact",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "dave",
      "real_name": "Dave",
      "display_name": "dave",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U28B92B56EE",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730976840.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "ff1be5d98e29525d67",
    "text": "love that idea. latency threshold?",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "carol",
      "real_name": "Carol",
      "display_name": "carol",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730977200.000001",
    "client_msg_id": "9e4e60dd9bbc829307",
    "text": "p99 latency > 1000ms is our SLO boundary. if we're in warning AND p99 > 1000ms, that's a real problem",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U2A4B17B116",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730977440.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "680065bf70a3b9757e",
    "text": "makes sense. degraded error rate AND slow latency together = real incident",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "erin",
      "real_name": "Erin",
      "display_name": "erin",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "UBFCDF3E6CA",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730978460.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "923e0f6032de7c7dc1",
    "text": "so: should_page = True if critical, OR if warning AND latency_p99_ms > 1000",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "dave",
      "real_name": "Dave",
      "display_name": "dave",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730978880.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "465e555097612b5c4e",
    "text": "exactly. note: > 1000, not >= 1000. latency at exactly 1000ms is within SLO",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U48181ACD22",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730979780.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "72abdb38f2f2dc8d4e",
    "text": "that distinction matters for the 1001ms case",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "bob",
      "real_name": "Bob",
      "display_name": "bob",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U28B92B56EE",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730985180.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "dbb762995f43a80382",
    "text": "so: latency_p99_ms > 1000 triggers page when in warning",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "carol",
      "real_name": "Carol",
      "display_name": "carol",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U522B276A35",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730986020.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "00f9bc6725e8b6e259",
    "text": "correct. paging on warning only if latency_p99_ms > 1000",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "alice",
      "real_name": "Alice",
      "display_name": "alice",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
  {
    "user": "U6525ABCCE7",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1730986860.000001",
    "client_msg_id": "deb41c46a7c93ed1a6",
    "text": "let me make sure I have this right: critical pages always. warning only pages if latency > 1000ms",
    "team": "T0EXACME01",
    "user_profile": {
      "name": "niaj",
      "real_name": "Niaj",
      "display_name": "niaj",
      "team": "T0EXACME01",
      "is_restricted": false,
      "is_ultra_restricted": false
    }
  },
